        "Available in aluminium EN AW-6082 / 3.2315 (to 200 °C), Stainless Steel 304 / 1.4301 (to 300 °C) and 316L / 1.4404 (to 350 °C), all from -196 °C, in short and long versions. Pressure range is 10⁻⁷ mbar to 2.5 bar. Bolts are A2-70 stainless hexagon head, M6 × 20 mm.",
