       "desc": "A stainless steel centering ring with an FKM O-ring and an integral mesh screen to stop coarse particles at a KF joint.",
       "about": [
        "The screen sits across the bore and catches larger debris before it travels into a pump or instrument. It is a simple guard for roughing lines.",
        "Rings are Stainless Steel 304 / 1.4301 (to 300 °C) or 316L / 1.4404 (to 350 °C), from -196 °C, in DN10, 16, 25, 40 and 50. The mesh is stainless steel, with an opening of about 1 mm and wire of about 0.3 mm. The O-ring shown is FKM.",
        "Mind the O-ring temperature range when choosing. Contact Vacprotech for pricing and availability."
       ],
