        "Main sizes are DN25, 40 and 50, reducing to DN10, 16, 25 or 40; listed pairs include 25/10, 25/16, 40/16, 40/25, 50/16, 50/25 and 50/40. Lengths are 28 or 40 mm. Aluminium EN AW-6082 T6 / 3.2315 works from -196 to 150 °C, Stainless Steel 304 / 1.4301 to 300 °C and 316L / 1.4404 to 350 °C. All are rated 1 × 10⁻⁸ mbar to 500 mbar overpressure with elastomer seals; stainless also 1 × 10⁻⁹ mbar with metal seals.",
