        "Sizes: DN16, DN40, DN63, DN100, DN160, DN200, DN250, DN300 and DN350, with M4, M6, M8 or M10 threads depending on size. Materials are Stainless Steel 304 / 1.4301, 316L / 1.4404 and 316LN ESR / 1.4429 ESU. Pressure range is 1 × 10⁻¹² mbar to ambient, with bake-out up to 450 °C; for 316LN ESR the specified limit is 1 × 10⁻¹³ mbar. Temperature range is −196 to 300 °C (304) and −196 to 350 °C (316L, 316LN ESR).",
