        "Sizes: DN16, DN25, DN40, DN50, DN63, DN75, DN100, DN125, DN160, DN200, DN250, DN300 and DN350. Grades are Stainless Steel 304 / 1.4301, 316L / 1.4404 and 316LN ESR / 1.4429 ESU. Pressure range is 1 × 10⁻¹² mbar to ambient and bake-out up to 450 °C; 316LN ESR extends to 1 × 10⁻¹³ mbar. Temperature range is −196 to 300 °C for 304 and −196 to 350 °C for the other two.",
        "316LN ESR is electroslag remelted, low in desorption, with μ ≤ 1.005, and is intended for ports that are dismantled often. Use a CF copper gasket of the same DN. Contact Vacprotech for pricing and availability."
