        "Analog input and output can be 0-5 Vdc, 1-5 Vdc, 0-10 Vdc or 4-20 mA, with RS232/RS485 (Modbus RTU) for digital communication. Electrical connection is a 9-pin Sub-D, with a 15-pin Sub-D, RJ11 or USB-C as listed alternatives. Valves are normally closed, with normally open as an option and a normally open valve on the 6111 series. A touch-screen display is available on the 6100/6101D versions, and IP65 water/dust resistance is an option. Specify the fluid, flow range, pressure rating and seal material when ordering; consult Vacprotech for higher viscosity options."
