        "The FDC-360 is the FDC-300 family model for the largest flows in the series; neighbouring bands are covered by the FDC-350. When ordering, state the process gas and full scale, MFC or MFM, the seal material (FKM, EPDM or BUNA) and Tube or VCR fittings."
